  "description": "The Vamoose Tri-Cycle DST is the ideal electric cycle for getting around town, making a grocery run, commuting to work, or cruising around the neighbourhood.\nSTABILITY, COMFORT & CONTROL\nThe Vamoose Tri-Cycle DST is powered by an upgraded 52V 750W rear drive motor, as well as a 52V 350W front motor! A first of its kind, this Vamoose Tri-Cycle is three-wheel-drive, with power driving through a rear differential to the rear tires as well as through the hub motor in the front . With three fat tires on the pavement, the Vamoose Tri-Cycle DST is ideal for anyone looking for extra stability, comfort, and control in their ride.\nWith a low step (about 15\"), this Vamoose Tri-Cycle DST is also ideal for anyone with hip or mobility challenges and comes standard with a folding handlebar stem to improve stowing. As well, the Vamoose Tri-Cycle DST comes standard with a large capacity rear rack, bag, and and front \"shovel\" rack for additional convenience.\nWith a 3-speed internally geared hub, powerful hydraulic disc brakes with parking assist, rear differential (dramatically improving handling, traction and reduces strain on the drivetrain including pedals, crank, chainring, cassette, and derailleur), and 20\" x 4\" fat puncture-resistant tires as well as a large 52W 25Ah battery, the Vamoose Tri-Cycle DST is ready to take you where you need to go.\nThis cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 52V 750W Rear and 350W Front Hub Motors,\n\n• 52V 25 Ah Samsung Battery\n\n• NEXUS geared hub shifter\n\n• Rear differential\n\n• Super comfortable plush seat\n\n• Water resistant rear carrier bag\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nDual Motor\n\nFront Motor:\nVAMOOSE 52V 350W\n\nMid Motor:\nN/A\n\nRear Motor:\nVAMOOSE 52V 750W\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO NEXUS 3-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nYes - twist throttle\n\nDisplay:\nLarge BC351 Colour with USB\n\nBattery:\n52V 25Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n3A\n\nFront forks :\nRST Forks with lock out\n\nRear Suspension:\nn/a\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nHydraulic w parking brake\n\nWheels:\n20\" X 4\" Chaoyang Mountain\n\nPedals:\nWellgo\n\nSaddle:\nComfort\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nRear carrier, bag, and front \"shovel\" rack\n\nFenders:\nStandard\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired, with Signal Light\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n45 Front /95 Rear Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n1300\n\nMiles per charge:\n65\n\nKms per charge:\n104\n\nBattery charge time:\n6-8 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n160 x 90 x 76\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n63 x 35 x 30\n\nWeights (metric):\n62kgs NW / 74kgs GW\n\nWeights (imperial):\n137lbs NW / 163lbs GW\n\nMax Speed (metric):\n32 km/h max speed\n\nMax Speed (imperial):\n20 m/h max speed\n\nMax Load:\n330 lbs.",
